      "title": "Add production failure telemetry feedback loop for prompt improvement",
      "priority": "medium",
      "description": "Failed stories and low-quality phase outputs contain signal for improving system prompts and hints. After each iteration, a script extracts failure patterns from checkpoint data and appends structured feedback to a prompt-improvements log, creating a closed-loop system where production failures drive prompt iteration.",
