      "id": "US-287",
      "title": "Add cyclomatic complexity gate: warn when story implementation exceeds threshold",
      "priority": "medium",
      "description": "After Phase I implementation, run a cyclomatic complexity analysis using radon on all Python files modified by the story. If any function exceeds SPIRAL_MAX_CYCLOMATIC_COMPLEXITY (default: 10), emit a warning to spiral_events.jsonl. When SPIRAL_COMPLEXITY_HARD_GATE=true, treat exceedance as a story failure.",
      "acceptanceCriteria": [
